              "You haven't placed any orders yet.\nStart shopping to see your history here!",
              style: Theme.of(context)
                  .textTheme
                  .bodyMedium
                  ?.copyWith(color: kColorTextSecondary, height: 1.4),
              textAlign: TextAlign.center,
